{"title":"Ming Dynasty’s Failure","synopsis":"Ini adalah bagian pertama dari adaptasi serial online terkenal! Lucu dan penuh lelucon, pasti akan menghibur pembaca! T: Siapa Fang Jipan? Pastor Jenderal: Dia anak saya yang hilang. terisak terisak; Kaisar: Setiap kali dia membuka mulutnya, kepalaku sakit; setiap kali dia mendekat, aku ingin lari. Pangeran: Dia satu-satunya penyebab kesengsaraan saya, dan alasan saya selalu dicaci maki. Fang Jipan: Hai teman-teman! Apakah kamu merindukan saya? Ayah Jenderal, Tuhan, Pangeran: Kita harus pergi sekarang!","alternative_title":"明朝败家子, The Prodigal Son of Ming Dynasty, Míng Cháo Bài Jiā Zi, Kẻ Ăn Hại Triều Minh","author":"Yueguan Baishao Comic Studio (关白勺漫画工作室)","artist":"Yuewen Manhua (阅文漫画)","genres":["Action","Comedy","Fantasy","Historical"],"chapters":[{"id":"ac43e366-af65-4190-99e3-92cff1754875","number":"104","title":"Chapter 104","date":"2026-07-30","images":[]},{"id":"3781b6c7-25b8-4fa4-9eff-f823c9eb7862","number":"103","title":"Chapter 103","date":"2026-07-29","images":[]},{"id":"367173e7-b0c6-4e24-b5e4-e4b112e4361d","number":"102","title":"Chapter 102","date":"2026-07-21","images":[]},{"id":"e7c08fca-0bb6-4008-8d7a-6d66945679d7","number":"101","title":"Chapter 101","date":"2026-07-08","images":[]},{"id":"e4af048a-cf59-4223-8420-e39b73978287","number":"100","title":"Chapter 100","date":"2026-07-05","images":[]},{"id":"b7fd0e42-4089-436f-b3d2-cb223edccb0a","number":"99","title":"Chapter 99","date":"2026-07-01","images":[]},{"id":"dcb8f928-485a-4d0f-8a8c-151fbd8a31e4","number":"98","title":"Chapter 98","date":"2026-06-24","images":[]},{"id":"3bdaf717-a173-4341-a7e0-f328a8a4c22e","number":"97","title":"Chapter 97","date":"2026-06-17","images":[]},{"id":"07e21a54-63b0-42c8-af1e-d97b27edacf1","number":"96","title":"Chapter 96","date":"2026-06-14","images":[]},{"id":"ddc5b48a-d203-45a0-a220-251418a7b00f","number":"95","title":"Chapter 95","date":"2026-06-07","images":[]},{"id":"c82b13ca-a069-47dd-91a4-0bf200a820d7","number